# Combined PDF with PNGs

When this project generates PNG files, also leave a single review PDF in the same folder. Do not write a second PDF of the same pages.

- Anchor review: `anchor.pdf` (already written by preprocess). Do not also stitch `pageNN.png` into `combined.pdf`.
- Question crops (`qN.png`): write `combined.pdf` from the original paper (no blue dots). Overwrite that PDF when the PNGs are regenerated. Crop the left edge at the anchor.
- Prefer `scripts/png_pdf.py` (`combine_pngs_to_pdf`) for question crops. It skips an existing output PDF.
- Point the user at the existing review PDF, not a list of PNGs.
